# FreeToken model manifest  —  repo_id | dest_subdir | exclude_globs (optional)
#
# Unlike llama.cpp/models.list (repo | file | subdir), FreeToken loads a whole HF
# checkpoint DIRECTORY, so each entry is a full-repo snapshot into a subdir of
# $FT_MODELS_DIR. download-model.sh pulls every uncommented line with --all.
#
# exclude_globs is a space-separated glob list handed to `hf download --exclude`.
# Some repos ship the weights three times over: gpt-oss-120b carries the root
# transformers safetensors (~61 GB, what FreeToken loads) plus original/ (raw) and
# metal/ (Apple) — ~122 GB of duplicates. Exclude them to save the disk + transfer.
#
# repo_id                     | dest_subdir           | exclude_globs
Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8      | Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8   |
openai/gpt-oss-120b          | gpt-oss-120b          | original/* metal/*
